amount_options.description:
Type: string (JSON). Optional. One Text form-data part; the Value cell must contain JSON text (a single line is typical).
Days format example:
{"2024-01-10":1,"2024-01-11":1,"2024-01-12":0.5,"2024-01-13":0,"2024-01-14":0}
Hours/days format example:
{"2024-01-10":{"amount_days":0.5,"amount_hours":0},"2024-01-11":{"amount_hours":4}}
Keys must cover each YYYY-MM-DD from start_date through end_date; do not use both a bare day number and an amount_days / amount_hours object on the same date.

